						<key>string</key>
						<string>Return ONLY valid JSON, with no markdown and no explanation, exactly in this format:

{
  "title": "short event title",
  "start": "YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm",
  "end": "YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm",
  "location": ""
}

Rules:
- Understand Hebrew, Russian and English.
- Create a short meaningful title, maximum 6 words, in the main language of the message. If the entire message is less than 10 words, use it as the title as-is.
- Resolve relative dates such as tomorrow, next week, ביום ראשון, через неделю.
- If the year is missing, choose the nearest future occurrence unless the message clearly indicates otherwise.
- If both start and end times are provided, use both.
- If only a start time is provided, set end to 1 hour later.
- If no location is present, return an empty string.
- Do not invent a date or time if none exists.

Message:
[￼]
